            "primaryConceptId": "concept.colon-diverticular-lower-bleeding.abscess-source-control.v1",
            "currentUpdate": "CT showed sigmoid inflammation and a rim-enhancing pelvic collection measuring 6 cm. There was no diffuse free fluid or remote gas. She had focal tenderness without generalized guarding, and blood pressure remained stable after fluid replacement. The interventional radiology review documented a percutaneous route that avoided bowel. Intravenous antibiotics had been started.",
