            "currentUpdate": "After drainage and antibiotics she developed increasing fever, tachycardia and broader abdominal tenderness. Drain output had fallen. CT showed the catheter tip in a nearly collapsed cavity and an enlarging rim-enhancing collection between bowel loops in a separate compartment. Interventional review found no route to that compartment that avoided bowel.",
