                "isCorrect": false,
                "rationale": "Interim argatroban was reasonable before confirmation. Continuing it as presumed HIT solely because of weak binding positivity disregards the valid negative functional assay. A strong immunoassay result with high clinical probability or concern about functional-assay validity would create a different conflict requiring specialist reconciliation.",
