            "label": "Absent esophageal body contractility with impaired junction relaxation",
            "isCorrect": false,
            "rationale": "This mistakes the quiet clustered-swallow phase for baseline failure and the presence of dysphagia for junction obstruction. Traveling baseline waves and the recorded relaxation behavior contradict those claims.",
            "serviceRequest": null
